      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNK YARD JEFF (3) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (17.54) at this track over 300m. Rates highly and will give a great sight. DUTCH RAMBO (1) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at this track finishing 5th and beaten only 5 lengths (17.69). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to his credit. Can measure up this time. MANX MAGIC (8) filled a minor placing last start at Cannington behind Crocodile Crawl (22.43) in a Grade 6. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Leading chance. WHISKEY BENT (2) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
